Drawing the radar is then just a matter of first drawing the background and then looping
through each blip and drawing it as an offset of the center of the radar:
const Vector2 cRadarPos(-390.0f, 275.0f);
DrawTexture(shader, mRadar, cRadarPos, 1.0f);
// Blips
for (const Vector2& blip : mBlips)
{
DrawTexture(shader, mBlipTex, cRadarPos + blip, 1.0f);
}
